#. 私は、父の事を何も知らない…
#. だから、父の想いなんて私にはわからない…
msgctxt "0001 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I didn't really know my father, so I can't pretend to\n"
"know what he was thinking."
msgstr ""

#. でも、きっと…私の父親なら…
#. 少なくとも血の繋がった父親なら…
msgctxt "0002 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But even if we're just connected by blood, there's one\n"
"thing I *am* sure of..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君を見捨てて、ここに残れなんて…
#. そんな事言うはずがない…
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"He would never want us to abandon Makoto and choose to\n"
"stay here."
msgstr ""

#. どうしてかはわからないけど…
#. それだけは確信出来るわ…
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I can't explain why, exactly. But if I'm sure of\n"
"anything, I'm sure of that..."
msgstr ""

#. 何も知らないからって…
#. 何もわからない訳じゃないって事なのかしら…
msgctxt "0005 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Just because we don't actually know anything, does\n"
"that mean we can't understand...?"
msgstr ""

#. これって、ひょっとして…
msgctxt "0006 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Could it be that...?"
msgstr ""

#. …いえ、なんでもないわ。
msgctxt "0007 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...No, never mind."
msgstr ""

#. それにね、苗木君…
msgctxt "0008 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So, Makoto..."
msgstr ""

#. あなたは<CLT 3>“幸運”<CLT>や<CLT 3>“不運”<CLT>なんかで、
#. この学園に来たんじゃないと思うの。
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I don't think you wound up at this school because you\n"
"had <CLT 3>good luck<CLT> or <CLT 3>bad luck<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. あなたが、この学園に来たのには、
#. もっと別の理由があったのよ。
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I think you came here for a different reason\n"
"entirely..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>“超高校級の絶望”<CLT>を打ち破ろうとする、
#. あなたは…
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You came here to bring down the <CLT 3>Ultimate Despair<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 最後まで諦めずに<CLT 3>“絶望”<CLT>に立ち向かおうとする
#. あなたは…
msgctxt "0012 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You came here to confront <CLT 3>despair<CLT> without ever\n"
"giving up."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>“超高校級の希望”<CLT>…そう呼べるんじゃないかしら？
msgctxt "0013 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And if that's true, I think we could call you...<CLT 3>the\n"
"Ultimate Hope<CLT>. What do you think?"
msgstr ""

#. なん…なの…？
msgctxt "0014 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Wh...what the...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>あんた<CLT>って…なんなのよぉぉおおおおッ！？
msgctxt "0015 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "What the hell <CLT 3>are you<CLT>!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>超高校級の希望<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>The Ultimate Hope<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 寒いって…寒いんだって…
msgctxt "0017 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "So uncool..."
msgstr ""

#. オマエラの顔付きも…オマエラの言葉も…
#. オマエラのやり取りも…
msgctxt "0018 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Your stupid faces... The stupid things you've said...\n"
"The stupid way you all treat each other...!"
msgstr ""

#. 寒い寒い！　そんなん流行ってないんだって！！
msgctxt "0019 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "It's all SO uncool! SO unhip!"
msgstr ""

#. ウザイ！ウザイ！ウザイ！ウザイ！ウザイ！
msgctxt "0020 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Shut up shut up shut up shut up SHUT UP!"
msgstr ""

#. ダサイ！ダサイ！ダサイ！ダサイ！ダサイ！
msgctxt "0021 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Lame lame lame lame LAME!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクはエリートでもないし…
#. 希望なんて言われる才能もないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm not any kind of elite anything. Hope isn't a\n"
"talent you develop, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But still...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも…ボクは…ッ！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I still...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
